page('/toddler/2-years/','Toddler classes at age 2: Toddler 3','What to teach a 2-year-old: colors and shapes through look, find and match games, real-world hunts and short parent-led Think & Talk classes from Kiddo School.',crumb([['Toddler','/toddler/'],['Age 2']])+heading('TODDLER 3','Age 2: colors, shapes and little games.','The Toddler 3 class. Two-year-olds love to point, name and match, so this stage adds big-button find-it games and matching play to the calm card classes — always parent-led, never a test.')+stagePageBody({chips:[['Age','2 Years'],['Class','Toddler 3'],['Subjects','Colors, shapes, matching']],stageLessons:[csLesson],subject:'Think &amp; Talk',soon:`<div class="fc-stage lesson-soon"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Earlier stage</span><span class="fc-class">18–24 Months</span></div><h3>Start with Toddler 2</h3><p>First concepts — big and small, up and down — live at <a href="/toddler/18-24-months/">18–24 months · Toddler 2</a>.</p></div>`}));
